text value=\"run1.start();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>run1</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>start</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
